flowchart TD
 A[Collected item] --> B{Exact asset in allow-list?}
 B -- No --> X[Reject and log scope violation]
 B -- Yes --> C{Duplicate fingerprint?}
 C -- Yes --> D[Drop duplicate and link original]
 C -- No --> E{Fresh within policy window?}
 E -- No --> F[Recoverable: re-query]
 E -- Yes --> G{Source reliable and verifiable?}
 G -- No --> F
 G -- Yes --> H[Accept as validated evidence]
